## Rules

- Record only reusable workflow friction or repeated patterns that would help
  future agents.
- Draft candidates in chat; append entries here only after the user approves
  them.
- Link concrete evidence: repo paths, docs, logs, QA results, issues, or PRs.
- Do not install, update, or publish skills from this file without explicit
  user approval in the current session.
- Prefer reviewed PRs against the skill source when a remote source exists.
